SR-176, SR-222, LLR-267/268/269/336 and affected interfaces. One initial `rg` using a Windows wildcard path failed; corrected to search the registry directory.\n- `$env:GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES = '\"'C:/Projects/ai-template.wt/review-tmp/2026-10-22c-leg13/r2'; & 'C:/Projects/ai-template/.venv/Scripts/python.exe' -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider -n 2 --basetemp 'C:/Projects/ai-template.wt/review-tmp/2026-10-22c-leg13/r2/sol/wi-961' 'tests/test_claude_transcripts.py' 'tests/test_usage_ingest.py' 'tests/test_usage_ingest_git.py' 'tests/test_prompts.py' 'tests/test_frame_context.py'\"'` -> `126 passed in 9.05s`.\n- `& '\"'C:/Projects/ai-template/.venv/Scripts/python.exe' 'project-trajectory/scripts/check_trajectory.py' --strict\"'` (once) -> `check_trajectory: clean (969 work item(s), 854 done (88%), 34 cancelled, graph acyclic).`\n- `& '\"'C:/Projects/ai-template/.venv/Scripts/python.exe' 'C:/Projects/ai-template.wt/review-tmp/2026-10-22c-leg13/r2/sol/run_trace.py'\"'` -> invokes this checkout'\"'s \"'`trace.py --root C:/Projects/ai-template.wt/wi-961 --strict-integrity` once, redirecting only its report publication to scratch to honor the no-worktree-write rule. Final line: `Traceability: SN=31 SR=136 LLR=323 TC=350 orphans=0 integrity=0 verified-mechanized=128 verified-demonstrated=6 verified-attested=0 drafts=22 budgets=4 budget-findings=0 components=4 component-findings=0 interfaces=252 interface-findings=0 ac-advisories=1 paraphrase-advisories=2. Report -> C:'\"\\\\Projects\\\\ai-template.wt\\\\wi-961\\\\docs\\\\test\\\\report.md\"'`. Exit 0; actual report is scratch/trace-report.md.\n- `git log -p --format=%h 1d6484cc5f0ba2f84c66df0138f3d1856fe1659d..c1bc3810046eea806e8d6ceff624535d15d71ec1 -- project-trajectory/scripts/session_adapters.py`, `git rev-parse c1bc381''^`, and `git show` of that parent'\"'s adapter and cycle skill -> isolated pre-fix behavior at \"'`4d755437a655900deaea952a8fe476b02ff24cec`, without relying on commit subjects.\n- `& '\"'C:/Projects/ai